{"articleNo":"119384","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=119384&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2014-2학기 생활관 퇴사 및 짐보관 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.12.17","hit":"3388","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>★ 퇴사 안내 ★</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 아래 절차 미 이행 시 경고 및 벌점 부여 예정임.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 퇴사일시 :</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 12. 22(월) 14:00 이전까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 퇴사절차</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1) 관생실 청소</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 관생실 및 실내 화장실을 깨끗하게 청소하고, 쓰레기는 분리수거한 뒤 퇴실하여야 함. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2) 냉장고 비우기</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 각 층에 비치된 공용 냉장고 내부의 개인 음식물을 모두 비움. 퇴실 완료 후 냉장고 내의 잔여 음식물은 모두 폐기 처리함. (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2학기에 이어 동계방학기간에 입사하는 학생도 모든 음식물을 빼야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3) 시설 및 물품 점검</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가구 위치가 변경</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">되었거나 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">시설 및 물품이 분실 또는 파손</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">되었을 시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">개인이 책임지고 원상 복구해야함.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 문제가 있을 시 사전에 각 동 경비실로 알리기 바람</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4) 스탠드 반납</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 반납기간 : 12. 15(월)~12.22(월) </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 반납장소 : 생활관 관리동 2층 학생자치회실</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 미반납&amp;분실 및 파손 시 개인이 보상해야 함.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5) 열쇠 반납</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- <font color=\"#0900ff\">푸름관생 : 푸름관 3동 경비실</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- <font color=\"#0900ff\">오름관생 : 오름관 방재실 107호</font></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(키 미반납시 재발급 비용 징수)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>★ 짐보관 안내 ★</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 공통사항</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">짐보관 및 수령시 주의사항</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 모든 짐은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">박스포장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">하여 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">겉면에 학번과 이름</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">을 크게 써서 맡기고, 찾을 때는 본인 확인 위해 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">신분증</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">을 반드시 제시</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. 보관개수</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1인당 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2box</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(장소 협소로 많은 관생이 짐보관 가능토록 제한)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 안내사항</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. 장기보관(2015-1학기 개강까지)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1) 푸름관/오름관</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 맡길 때 : 12/19(금),12/22(월) 12시~18시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 찾을 때 : 2015-1학기 입사시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 장소 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">푸름관 1동 지하 다목적실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#666666\">1) 신평관</font></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">○ 맡길 때 : 12/19(금),12/22(월) 12시~18시</font></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">○ 찾을 때 : 2015-1학기 입사시</font></span></span></span></span></font></span></span></span></span></p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\">○ 장소 : </font></span></span></span></span></font></span></span></span></span><font color=\"#e20000\">신평관 1층 관리실</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u><font color=\"#ea0909\">★ 단, 2015년 2월25일까지 중간에 짐을 찾아가는 것은 불가</font></u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. 단기보관(동계방학 입사자)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1) 푸름관</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 맡길 때 : 12/19(금),12/22(월) 12시~18시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 찾을 때 : 12/23(화) 12시~18시 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 장소 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">푸름관 1동 지하 다목적실</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2) 오름관 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 맡길 때 : 12/19(금),12/22(월) 12시~18시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 찾을 때 : 12/23(화) 12시~18시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">장소 : </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">오름관 1층 체력단련실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#666666\">※ 기타문의사항은 478-7943(푸름관), 479-4603(오름관)으로 문의.</font></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014. 12.</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과